{"_id":"6aadb4d92bf200d05b70add9","title":"BHRM5 OPERATOR TOOL 2.1 Silent aim","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7864c","gameId":2916899287,"name":"Blackhawk Rescue Mission 5","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bf10322bb98041d76bb70e2f2d5fb7e61209597d0898ff5d894f7a06932f4966.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a41e82a66bf9b7d40a8a8f8f1594eb8a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"2916899287-blackhawk-rescue-mission-5","path":"/game/2916899287-blackhawk-rescue-mission-5","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bf10322bb98041d76bb70e2f2d5fb7e61209597d0898ff5d894f7a06932f4966.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a41e82a66bf9b7d40a8a8f8f1594eb8a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":2916899287},"slug":"Blackhawk-Rescue-Mission-5-BHRM5-OPERATOR-TOOL-2-Silent-aim-228823","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":3604,"executes":7389,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8a1878b3fa89625861a8bd28ae6177003ce2a4227f67b28ce61b6c0a506c6a79.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-fc0c2b424652e05d6034fd2b6c7453ee-ac7fdd0cfb34.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-fc0c2b424652e05d6034fd2b6c7453ee-ac7fdd0cfb34.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8a1878b3fa89625861a8bd28ae6177003ce2a4227f67b28ce61b6c0a506c6a79.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-fc0c2b424652e05d6034fd2b6c7453ee-ac7fdd0cfb34.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-fc0c2b424652e05d6034fd2b6c7453ee-ac7fdd0cfb34.png"},"likeCount":5,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-18T22:02:01.945Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-18T22:02:01.945Z","lastBump":"2026-09-18T22:02:01.945Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alhgeman/BHRM5-OPERATOR-TOOLS-2/refs/heads/main/BHRM5%20Tool%202\"))()","features":"features\n- Wall ESP — every hostile gets a vis-box on the head plus a live distance tag. Boxes update in real time: green means a clear bullet path, red means cover between you and him. Round-robin visibility pass, no target starvation, no fps hit.\n- Silent Aim — FOV 140 lock that never snaps your camera. Refreshes at 33Hz against live target positions so moving NPCs are tracked in real time. Sticky target logic stops crosshair flicker. Head / Root aim switchable in the UI.\n- Aggressive Wallbang — spawns the round 0.5m from his skull and skips all cover, regardless of wall thickness. Works seamstessly with Silent Aim; spread cone at that distance is ~0, so every shot lands.\n- No Recoil + No Spread — recoil killed at the source (impulse null), spread zeroed per-shot with instant restore. No weapons jam, no camera freeze, reload stays functional.\n- Fullbright — kills shadows and fog, near-daylight visibility.\n- Smart target priority — a visible target always beats a walled one; walled targets only get engaged when wallbang is on. Other NPCs' bodies never count as walls.\n- Self-protection — auto-detects your own third-person body and never locks it. Crosshair eats enemies, not your own skull.\n- Live HUD — active-feature pill, target count, FPS counter.\n- UI — click-drag anywhere, minimize, INSERT to toggle visibility, one-tap UNLOAD restores everything clean.\nwhat's new in v2.3\n- rebuilt spread handling — the old gun-jam on fire is gone\n- recoil now killed via impulse null only — no camera freeze, no stuck reloads\n- better vis-aim sync — ESP color now matches exactly what aim will lock\n- faster, lighter core; rapid-fire and big-mag removed for stability\nusage\nload with your executor in PVE mode. paste, pick a mode, toggle features. INSERT hides the panel.\nPVP tease (save for the next update)\nPVP build is in active development — real-player targeting on the same core. follow for release when it drops.","tags":["bhrm","blackhawk","silentaim","esp","npc"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/CXdqamrD6","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"68